{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746962734939242559","content":"So I'm going to make a counterbid to the recent discussion:\n\nMost tables seem to allow most races and classes.  This game has a lot, and I mean A LOT, of homebrew.  Stuff you wont find as options in any other game.  We work hard to make the custom stuff balanced, and the good news is, if something doesn't make sense, you can work with the DMs to fix it.  Its the only time you as the player get the opportunity to directly interact with the creation process.\n\nI just got done having a blast playing a Wudgie Barbarian Lumberjacked in a game that was used to test the homebrew, and it was a blast.  Gill (which is my favorite character of all time) was originally going to be a halfling, til I decided to play a Chinn.  So if you are unsure what to play, my suggestion is take a look at the things you won't find elsewhere.","created_at":"2021-05-21T12:51:25.172000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"845282636661522442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
